    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...you<strong> Leap...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You stand at the bottom of a pit, a lone figure... Above you, only ledges, cliffs, and the long, punishing climb to the summit.\u00a0 With a single <strong>Leap</strong>, you begin your ascent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...you<strong> Leap...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every <strong>Leap</strong> is a decision.\u00a0 Every <strong>Leap</strong> is a chance at progress.\u00a0 Every fall\u2026 is a lesson in despair.\u00a0 No mercy.\u00a0 Just you, gravity, and the relentless pull of failure.\u00a0 One misplaced <strong>Leap</strong>, and you plummet\u2014losing minutes, hours, maybe even your sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...you<strong> Leap...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like Sisyphus condemned to roll his boulder, you will climb again and again, knowing the pit owes you nothing.\u00a0 Yet something within you refuses to quit. Is it hope?\u00a0 Stubbornness?\u00a0 Or just madness creeping in?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...you<strong> Leap...</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-High Stakes Platforming!</strong><br>The higher you climb, the closer to victory.\u00a0 But also the farther you will fall!<br><br><strong>-Simple Controls!</strong><br>Hold Space to charge and then release it to\u00a0<strong>LEAP</strong>.<br><br><strong>-Think Before you LEAP!</strong><br>Every <strong>LEAP</strong> requires much patience and thought, <strong>DON'T RUSH IT!</strong>\u00a0Or you will certainly fall back to the bottom...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LEAP</strong> is a simple to control game where you climb to the top only by <strong>LEAP</strong>ing into the air.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The higher you jump, the harder you fall</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enable checkpoints, which you can teleport back to.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extremely difficult but addictive gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 brutal floors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built in speed running timer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NO annoying music or sfx at all so you can listen to your favorite music and LOCK IN!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...you<strong> Leap...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...you<strong> Leap...</strong></p>",
